      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Su esposo Osiris era el rey de Egipto, y su pueblo lo amaba como a nadie.",
          "en": "Her husband Osiris was king of Egypt, and his people loved him like no one else."
        },
        {
          "es": "Antes de él, los hombres vivían como bestias. Osiris les enseñó a sembrar trigo y cebada, y a vivir con leyes.",
          "en": "Before him, men lived like beasts. Osiris taught them to sow wheat and barley, and to live by laws."
        },
        {
          "es": "Cuando Egipto estuvo en orden, partió a recorrer el mundo para enseñar lo mismo a otros pueblos.",
          "en": "When Egypt was in order, he set out across the world to teach other peoples the same."
        },
        {
          "es": "No llevaba ejércitos. Conquistaba a la gente con música y con palabras.",
          "en": "He took no army with him. He won people over with music and with words."
        },
        {
          "es": "Mientras tanto, Isis gobernaba Egipto con tanto cuidado que ningún enemigo encontraba una grieta.",
          "en": "Meanwhile Isis ruled Egypt so carefully that no enemy could find a crack to slip through."
        }
      ],
