      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "En secreto, Set tomó la medida exacta del cuerpo de Osiris, de la cabeza a los pies.",
          "en": "In secret, Set took the exact measure of Osiris’s body, from head to foot."
        },
        {
          "es": "Con esa medida mandó construir un cofre hermoso, tallado y pintado con todo el arte de los artesanos.",
          "en": "From that measure he had a chest made, beautiful, carved and painted with all the skill of the craftsmen."
        },
        {
          "es": "Un cofre así no parecía una trampa. Parecía un regalo.",
          "en": "A chest like that did not look like a trap. It looked like a gift."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y Set guardó su secreto hasta la noche de un gran banquete.",
          "en": "And Set kept his secret until the night of a great banquet."
        }
      ],
