      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Esa noche hubo un gran banquete en el palacio, y entre los invitados estaban los setenta y dos conjurados.",
          "en": "That night there was a great banquet at the palace, and among the guests were the seventy-two conspirators."
        },
        {
          "es": "De pronto, Set hizo entrar el cofre, y todos se quedaron mirándolo con asombro.",
          "en": "Suddenly Set had the chest carried in, and every guest stared at it in wonder."
        },
        {
          "es": "«Será para quien quepa dentro», dijo Set, como si fuera un juego.",
          "en": "“It will belong to whoever fits inside,” said Set, as if it were a game."
        },
        {
          "es": "Uno por uno, los invitados se acostaron en el cofre. A ninguno le quedaba bien.",
          "en": "One by one the guests lay down in the chest. It fit none of them."
        },
        {
          "es": "Hasta que llegó el turno de Osiris, que no sospechaba nada, y se acostó dentro.",
          "en": "Until it was Osiris’s turn. He suspected nothing, and lay down inside."
        }
      ],
